  description: "You can only activate each effect of \"Sylvan Princessprout\" once
    per turn.\r\n\u25CF You can Tribute this card; excavate the top card of your
    Deck, send it to the Graveyard, then you can place 1 \"sprout\" monster in your
    Graveyard on top of your Deck.\r\n\u25CF If this card is excavated from the Deck
    and sent to the Graveyard by a card effect: You can declare a Level from 1 to
    8; Special Summon this card from the Graveyard, and if you do, it becomes that
    Level."
